	quest.2E3975CD6F8690A0.quest_desc: [
		"Rifts can be opened using clocks at a certain time."
		""
		"However, as time changes, it is a chore to always keep track of it."
		""
		"This is where the &bFrozen Clock &fcomes in."
		""
		"Use &eFlint and Steel&f on top of a &bSnow Block &fand throw in &bIce Stone &fto turn it into &bIcy Fire."
		""
		"Throw a &eClock &fat a certain time into &bIcy Fire &fand it will forever be set to that time, turning into a &bFrozen Clock."
		""
		"For your first Twilight dimension, that time should be in the middle of the day."
		""
		"For later dimensions, you will need special obsidian blocks for stability, or else the rift will collapse before you have the chance to enter."
	]
